      "publicIdentifier": "mjindal",
      "headline": "President and COO | Scaling GTM from $0-$1B+ | Board Member & Investor | Ex. Cloudflare, Arize AI, Insight Partners, Splunk",
      "about": "I've spent my career building and scaling revenue functions for AI and SaaS companies. I'm a modern GTM operator and first-principles thinker, always pushing the boundaries of how GTM could be architected. I consider myself AI-pilled: leveraging AI across the end-to-end customer lifecycle to do things better, faster, and cheaper.At Cloudflare, I was employee #45 and ran the GTM function, co-managing the revenue function with the President of revenue, Chris Merritt. Over 10 years, I helped architect the GTM motion that took the company from pre-revenue to $1.3B — through the IPO in 2019 and 13 straight quarters of beating targets post-IPO, and a current valuation of $70B+From there, I moved into the AI evals and observability space as President of GTM at Arize — leading sales, marketing, customer success, and operations, and doubling ARR in under a year.Today, I'm helping scale Composio, the \"action\" infrastructure layer that lets AI agents actually do things in the world. We're early, we're moving fast, and we're hiring.I also angel invest and advise early-stage startups on all things GTM: zero to first revenue, positioning, hiring, and scaling.If you're building something ambitious, I want to hear about it.",
